Package: claude-usage-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends}
Description: Prometheus exporter for Claude plan usage limits
 Serves the usage windows of a Claude subscription (the numbers Claude Code
 shows under /usage: five-hour and weekly utilization, reset times, per-model
 weekly limits) as Prometheus metrics. It reads the Claude CLI's existing
 OAuth login from ~/.claude/.credentials.json and queries the usage endpoint
 at most once per cache period. Login health (token expiry and refresh
 times) is exported too; token values never are.
 .
 The package ships a per-user systemd unit and a system template unit
 (claude-usage-exporter@USER.service). Neither is enabled on install.
